{"version":1,"content":"<p>微軟正在持續推進Windows 11史上規模最大的界面現代化工程，而最新跡象顯示，這項計劃已經延伸到了系統中最古老的組成部分之一——磁盤碎片整理工具。長期以來被視為「上古遺產」的系統組件，如今也開始獲得全新的設計語言和技術架構支持，這被外界視為微軟重新擁抱WinUI原生框架的重要信號。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584844.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T08:02:11.501624+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T07:55:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T07:58:38.660762+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T07:58:38.660762+00:00","content_hash":"04b78f35da2aefdc4ac9a671d238d68301f36821b1cd0e690cfcc73d0692a43e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}